---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { EMAIL } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout
  title="Transfer a premium domain | desigr.monster"
  description="How to buy a domain from desigr.monster: escrow, registrar push, and a direct note to sales@desertrich.com in Phoenix."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-14">
    <h1 class="display text-5xl">The transfer</h1>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>desigr.monster is a private domain desk in Phoenix. The names listed here are held for sale. There is no broker network and no bid history to perform.</p>
      <p>Payment runs through Escrow.com. A same-registrar push is preferred. Cross-registrar transfers use an auth code after funds are locked.</p>
      <p>Offers saved in the browser stay on your device. To start a transfer, write {EMAIL}.</p>
    </div>
    <h2 class="mt-12 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">What we will not do</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
      <li>Take a wire to a personal account.</li>
      <li>Lease a name with a buyout that resets every month.</li>
      <li>Inflate a view counter. The figures on each file are rounded and static.</li>
    </ul>
    <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}?subject=Transfer%20question`} class="mt-10 inline-flex h-12 items-center rounded-lg bg-ink px-5 text-sm text-bg dark:bg-ink-dark dark:text-bg-dark">Write the desk</a>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
